The charter defines:

- institutional name and abbreviation;
- founder;
- mission;
- theoretical foundations;
- research areas;
- publication program;
- relationships to Lee Sharks, Rex Fraction, Jack Feist, the Crimson Hexagon, and the Assembly;
- citation norms;
- non-accreditation status.

Its methodological commitments include:

- rigor without gatekeeping;
- cross-register publication;
- provenance-first scholarship;
- AI-aware composition;
- retrocausal orientation.
